         <section class="faq-list" aria-label="Frequently asked questions about cats">
           <div class="example">
             <h2 class="question-heading">Why do cats purr?</h2>
             <div class="details">
               <p>Cats often purr when they feel relaxed, but purring can also be a self-soothing behavior when they are stressed, injured, or asking for comfort.</p>
             </div>
           </div>
           <div class="example">
             <h2 class="question-heading">How much sleep do cats need?</h2>
             <div class="details">
